<title>USA: Churchill Downs Inc yr net rises.</title>
<headline>Churchill Downs Inc yr net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended    Year Ended   Year Ended</p>
<p>				    Dec 31,	Dec 31,	Dec 31,</p>
<p>					1996	   1995	   1994</p>
<p> Net revenues	    $107,858,818  $92,434,216  $66,419,460</p>
<p> Net earnings		 8,071,526    6,203,135    6,166,353</p>
<p>Net earnings per share (based</p>
<p>on weighted average shares</p>
<p>outstanding of 3,724,557,</p>
<p>3,784,140 and 3,778,350,</p>
<p>  respectively)		    2.17	   1.64	   1.63</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
